seg-bcb9cb9c6219 = The closing of the loop is the point: <c1/> produces exactly the white-acceleration PSD that the rest of the inertial stack already integrates into a velocity/position error — so a quantum sensor's noise can be traced to its atom number, interrogation time, and contrast rather than to a datasheet line.

