seg-525c382e813b = <b>Fringe-ambiguity resolution</b> — the model states the unambiguous range and returns the wrapped phase; it does not unwrap a reading outside ±<c1/> (for example with a classical accelerometer or several interrogation times), and it bounds the range for an ideal three-pulse fringe, with no wavefront or contrast-loss terms.

